100→      `,
101→      TextBody: `New waitlist signup\n\nA customer (${customerEmail}) just joined the waitlist for ZIP code ${zipCode}.\n\nManage the waitlist from your ${name} admin dashboard.`,
102→      MessageStream: "outbound",
